abstract: "Public validation and provenance repository supporting the manuscript Vertex Eccentricity Labeled Energy for Power-Grid Vulnerability Screening with DC-Flow Validation. The live main branch contains executable MATPOWER 8.1/GNU Octave cross-validation, pinned benchmark provenance and environment metadata, selected portable stage code, frozen physical-branch outage summary outputs, licensing information and continuous-integration checks. The complete manuscript-associated archival bundle is to be frozen in the v1.0.0-submission release before journal submission."
keywords:
